{"id": "t145-010", "text": "Lucy's uni interview went ok she thinks. hears back in 2 wks", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hears back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 2 wks", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t145-016", "text": "Kavya's sister Tanvi sitting her GCSEs from next month - Kavya doing the revision timetable w/ her every evening", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSEs", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t145-021", "text": "Jack - bar exam results out Friday. his partner Chen said he's been a wreck all wk, not eating, checking the portal every hour even though it doesn't open till 9am Fri. Chen's planned a dinner for Sat either way. don't forget to text Jack after, and maybe drop round something nice for Chen too, she's carrying it all", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exam results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "all wk"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "every hour"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till 9am Fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Jack", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round something nice for Chen", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t145-022", "text": "Abdi promoted to sous chef @ Hadiza's restaurant. Hadiza says he's earned it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to sous chef", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "restaurant", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t145-024", "text": "Tadhg - hurling trials Sat morning. his mum driving him, I'm picking him up afterwards", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hurling trials", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t145-025", "text": "Carmen Gonzalez - starts as deputy head after half term. ask how the first wk goes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen Gonzalez", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "deputy head", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the first wk goes", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t145-028", "text": "Ming's dad retiring next month after 40 yrs as a GP, big party planned 3 wks Sat at the golf club. Ming's in charge of the cake + speech, she's stressing, her brother's meant to help but he's useless apparently. her dad has no idea about the party. offered to help w/ the slideshow the wk before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "40 yrs as a GP", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 wks Sat", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t145-034", "text": "Eduardo's dad Mr Popescu? no - that's Simone's dad. Mr Popescu has his hip op next Wed, Simone taking the wk off to look after him", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eduardo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mr Popescu", "owner": "p3", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mr Popescu", "owner": "p3", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wed", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the wk off", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t145-036", "text": "Giulia's partner Katarzyna started @ the hospital pharmacy, nights for first month", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started @ the hospital pharmacy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "first month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t145-038", "text": "Elijah's cat Pickle went missing Sat, back Mon. he was in bits", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t145-040", "text": "Niamh starts the new job @ Ofcom Mon. her old boss gave her a terrible ref apparently, nearly lost the offer. she's anxious abt the 6 month probation and the commute from Reading. her partner Tadhg doing the school run now so she can get the early train. remind me to ring her end of first wk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job @ Ofcom", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Mon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "commute from Reading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tadhg", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing the school run", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of first wk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t145-046", "text": "Jack Williams - promotion interview Wed, panel of 3 incl. the new MD. he's up against Graham from accounts, who everyone thinks has it. prep call w/ him Tues eve, go through the case study, then ask how it went Thurs. if he gets it he starts the role in Jan", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack Williams", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wed", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "MD", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from accounts", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "prep call w/ him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues eve", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go through the case study", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thurs", "anchor": "a3"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Jan", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t145-057", "text": "long call w/ Mila tonight. she finally handed in notice - last day is the 14th. boss tried to talk her out of it. new place is a startup, more money but no pension. she's nervous abt the jump but sure it's right. her flatmate Lucy is moving out at the same time so it's all happening at once. should get her a card + something for the new desk. ask her the wk after how it's going", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handed in notice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "startup", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sure it's right", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same time", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her a card + something for the new desk", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wk after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t145-060", "text": "Katarzyna (Kasia) - her brother Elijah's on the stage crew for the school play, opening night next Thurs. she wants us to come. her parents are both away so she's doing the lifts the day before for dress rehearsal and the night itself. Elijah's apparently mortified she's told everyone", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the stage crew", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "opening night", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thurs", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dress rehearsal", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night itself", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mortified", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p3"}]}
